# The Talekeeper's Gift (bastok 56, WAR AF3): Deidogg and Detzo in Bastok Mines, the ??? (qm_talekeeper) and Picklix
# Longindex, Moxnix Nightgoggle and Doglix Muttsnout (TALEKEEPERS_GIFT_OFFSET + 0, 1, 2) in Behemoth's Dominion, the
# zone-in to Qufim Island. The guard (The Talekeeper's Truth completed, main job WAR, main level AF3_QUEST_LEVEL 50, its
# own Timer reached and no mustZone): The Talekeeper's Truth's 165 is played here, so its completion sets both. While
# available, Deidogg's 170 (Prog 1), Detzo's 171 (Prog 2), the Ginger Cookie at Prog 2 (172: accepted, Prog 0); then
# the ???'s 100 (declined; then the three NMs: Picklix claimed, the others on enmity), the kills (Prog bits 2, 1, 0: 7)
# and the zone-in to Qufim Island from Behemoth's Dominion at Prog 7: 100, the reward (those in #nms, at level 75 for the
# NMs). Defaults: Deidogg 32 (but The
# Talekeeper's Truth's 166 replaceDefault once completed), Detzo 30, the ??? NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY. Detzo's mission
# (8-2) needs what this char lacks.
lists BastokMines/Deidogg/onTrigger BastokMines/Deidogg/onTrade BastokMines/Detzo/onTrigger BastokMines/onEventFinish/170 BastokMines/onEventFinish/171 BastokMines/onEventFinish/172 BehemothsDominion/qm_talekeeper/onTrigger BehemothsDominion/onEventFinish/100 QufimIsland/onZoneIn/1 QufimIsland/onEventFinish/100
char zone=BastokMines pos=-13,7,29 job=WAR lvl=50
quest Bastok.TheTalekeepersTruth accepted
charvar Quest[1][55]Prog 2
item BoneChip
item GingerCookie x2
login
trigger Deidogg                 # The Talekeeper's Truth, Prog 2, no Timer: its 165
finish                          # The Talekeeper's Truth completed: this quest's Timer (tomorrow) and mustZone
trigger Deidogg                 # the Timer and the mustZone: not offered; The Talekeeper's Truth's 166
finish
trade Deidogg GingerCookie x1   # not offered: nothing
rezone                          # the mustZone cleared
trigger Deidogg                 # the Timer not reached: not offered; 166
finish
wait vana=24
trade Deidogg GingerCookie x1   # offered, Prog 0, the cookie: nil
trigger Detzo                   # available, Prog 0: nil, his default 30
finish
trigger Deidogg                 # Prog 0: 170
finish                          # Prog 1
trigger Deidogg                 # Prog 1: nil; 166
finish
trigger Detzo                   # Prog 1: 171
finish                          # Prog 2
trigger Detzo                   # Prog 2: nil, 30
finish
trigger Deidogg                 # Prog 2: nil; 166
finish
trade Deidogg BoneChip x1       # Prog 2, not the cookie: nil
trade Deidogg GingerCookie x1   # Prog 2, the cookie: 172
finish                          # the cookie taken, accepted, Prog 0
trigger Deidogg                 # accepted: no handler; 166
finish
